  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Select <math><mi>K</mi></math> letters from <math><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></math> in <math><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow></msub></math> ways.<br />Select <math><mn>1</mn></math> of the mail boxes in <math><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> way.<br />Remaining <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> letters each have <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> options and can be allotted in <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></msup></math> ways.<br />Hence, the required number of ways <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>K</mi><none/><mprescripts/><mrow/><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><mrow/><mi>N</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math>",
